---
interface Props { where?: string }
const { where = '' } = Astro.props;
---
<h2 id="s-regulars" data-toc="Regulars">Regulars</h2>
<p class="dim">How often people give{where}, and how big each superchat is, for cross-channel donors and for people who give on one channel only. Each bar is a share of its own group, because one-channel donors far outnumber the others. The charts follow the filters above but ignore any selected people.</p>
<div class="hkey" id="hkey"></div>
<div class="multiples" id="hists"></div>
